OL,3,GNEWSABus driver arrested after
OL,4,Apedestrian dies in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fpedestrian died following a crash.
OL,9,FIt happened on Coxford Road,
OL,10,FSouthampton, on Thursday shortly before
OL,11,F16:20 BST. Hampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,12,Fpolice said the pedestrian, a woman in
OL,13,Fher 50s died at the scene.
OL,15,FThe force said a 54-year-old man from
OL,16,FWhiteley, had been arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of drink driving and drug
OL,18,Fdriving. He has been released under
OL,19,Finvestigation while inquiries continue.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
